<!--
  Indonesian. Kept in sync with values-in/ on purpose: Android reports the
  Indonesian locale either as "id" or with the legacy ISO code "in" depending
  on the API level, and aapt2 stores them as two separate configurations. Having
  both guarantees the translation is picked up in either case.
-->
